                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm a sucker for Fishing minigames and this whole game is essentially that, you get what you see here if you like fishing mechanics or relaxing games think about picking this up on a discount, it can drag on a bit with the grind gong for 100% but it was still a fun game to have open in the background while you watch a show or something, it has upgrades and progression to keep you going as well as some story elements that i admittedly skipped but overall it's good.",
